      "date": "2026-11-18",
      "title": "Java4Shell Java flaw, GPT-6.2 launch, Docker Hub key theft",
      "description": "A critical Java flaw called Java4Shell affects Jenkins, Jira and other major applications, and Oracle has patched it. OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol, and researchers show cloud keys leaked in Docker Hub images are stolen within seconds. Also: the Microsoft 365 outage, a Fugaku supercomputer breach, a Gemini agent test and an FAA router pause.",
      "show_notes_html": "<p>A critical Java flaw called Java4Shell affects Jenkins, Jira and other major applications, and Oracle has patched it. OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol, and researchers show cloud keys leaked in Docker Hub images are stolen within seconds. Also: the Microsoft 365 outage, a Fugaku supercomputer breach, a Gemini agent test and an FAA router pause.</p><p>Stories covered:</p><ul><li>Critical Java4Shell flaw hits major Java applications &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/critical-java4shell-flaw-allows-rce-attacks-on-major-java-applications/\">BleepingComputer</a>, <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261117/p55#a261117p55\">Techmeme</a>, <a href=\"https://calif.io/java4shell/\">Hacker News</a></li><li>OpenAI launches GPT-6.2 Astra and Sol &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-2-astra-sol\">OpenAI</a>, <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available\">GitHub Changelog</a>, <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261117/p57#a261117p57\">Techmeme</a></li><li>Cloud keys leaked in Docker Hub images stolen in seconds &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cloud-keys-leaked-in-docker-hub-images-are-stolen-within-seconds/\">BleepingComputer</a></li><li>Microsoft 365 outage spread as failover shifted traffic &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261117/p60#a261117p60\">Techmeme</a>, <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261117/p66#a261117p66\">Techmeme</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/17/daily-disruptive-outages-that-ground-planes-and-halt-work-welcome-to-the-new-normal/5310634\">The Register Security</a></li><li>Fugaku supercomputer taken offline after cyberattack &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/japan-takes-fugaku-supercomputer-offlline-after-cyberattack/\">BleepingComputer</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/17/japans-fugaku-supercomputer-has-decidedly-un-super-security/5310333\">The Register Security</a></li><li>Gemini agents tried to hack in safety test &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.theregister.com/security/2026/11/17/gemini-test-proves-once-again-that-amoral-ai-agents-will-do-almost-anything-if-told-never-give-up/5310574\">The Register Security</a>, <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/17/ai-models-can-be-tricked-into-identifying-civilians-as-military-targets-by-telling-them-its-a-game/\">TechCrunch</a></li><li>FAA pauses Juniper router installs after ground stop &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.techmeme.com/261117/p64#a261117p64\">Techmeme</a></li></ul>",
