      "title": "Nvidia CEO Huang resigns, Cursor extension attack, FBI warns of ARTEX",
      "description": "Today's brief covers Jensen Huang's exit as Nvidia CEO, the Cursor and Fireworks A I incident behind a tampered Claude Code extension, and an F B I warning about the ARTEX attack framework. It also covers an A W S sign-in outage in US East one and a data breach at France's Maileva.",
      "show_notes_html": "<p>Today&#x27;s brief covers Jensen Huang&#x27;s exit as Nvidia CEO, the Cursor and Fireworks A I incident behind a tampered Claude Code extension, and an F B I warning about the ARTEX attack framework. It also covers an A W S sign-in outage in US East one and a data breach at France&#x27;s Maileva.</p><p>Stories covered:</p><ul><li>Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang steps down amid spy scandal &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/column/1033943/jensen-huang-nvidia-china-spying-scandal-resignation\">The Verge AI</a>, <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1033984/congress-export-rules-ai-chips-china\">The Verge</a></li><li>Stolen key led to tampered Claude Code extension in Cursor &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/stolen-fireworks-ai-key-led-to-cursor.html\">The Hacker News</a></li><li>FBI warns ARTEX A I tool is automating cyberattacks &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/fbi-warns-artex-ai-hacking-tool-is-powering-global-cyberattacks/\">BleepingComputer</a></li><li>AWS sign-in and connectivity errors in US-EAST-1 &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://status.aws.amazon.com/\">AWS Status</a></li><li>Cyberattack on La Poste unit exposes data of 22 million &mdash; Sources: <a href=\"https://databreaches.net/2026/11/15/hack-at-french-postal-unit-exposes-22-million-peoples-data/\">DataBreaches.net</a></li></ul>",
